      <p>
        Design decision rules before emotional pressure arrives so that
        important choices are not made entirely in the moment.
      </p>

      <a
        href="https://sites.google.com/view/pathkeeper/single-pre-commitment"
        class="card-link"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Explore System <span>→</span>
